# local / ops docs (environment-specific setup + smoke notes)
# Contents, not the directory: ignoring `docs/` itself stops git descending,
# and then no negation inside it can ever match.
docs/*
# ...except what README links to: it must not have broken links after a clone
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/architecture/
